  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerated Immunisations and Health System Strengthening PNG Phase 2 (AIHSS2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Immunisation Activity Extension (Phase 2) aims to:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;expand the programme from coverage of 12 provinces in Phase 1 to 15 provinces in Phase 2&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;strengthen Provincial Health Authorities (PHAs)&#xa0;Public Financial Management and planning capabilities and practices to&#xa0;support routine immunisation&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;embed gender equality, disability, and social inclusion principles in routine immunisation to increase equity and reach of routine immunisation service delivery&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;improve programme management and governance&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
